              "text": "Transfer a file to a remote server using the mcp__agent-ml-research__ssh_execute tool.\n\nThe file is introduction.tex. You need to:\n1. Read the local file at /home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/docs/paper/introduction.tex\n2. Base64 encode it locally using Bash: `base64 -w0 /home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/docs/paper/introduction.tex`\n3. Use mcp__agent-ml-research__ssh_execute to write it on the remote server westd-11235 (account=\"root\"):\n   `echo '<base64_content>' | base64 -d > /root/trace-verdict-study/docs/paper/introduction.tex && md5sum /root/trace-verdict-study/docs/paper/introduction.tex`\n4. Verify the md5sum matches by checking: `md5sum /home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/docs/paper/introduction.tex`\n\nReport: the remote md5sum and local md5sum, and whether they match."
